gle Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-slider\" style=\"background-image:url('img/slider8.png')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1> <span> Namibia, Windhoek, 11 August 2024</span> </h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Promoting Intra-Africa and Global Collaboration in Higher Education</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"brusselreport.html\" class=\"btn\">Read More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"namibiareport.html\" class=\"btn primary\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t <!-- Start Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-slider\" style=\"background-image:url('img/slider12.png')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1> <span> CSAS Team participates in the 48th Graduation Ceremony at Egerton University</span> <span> </span></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>L-R Dr. Losira Nasirumbi, Prof. Mwanarusi Saidi, Prof Patiece Mshenga and Dr. Sarah Akello</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"brusselreport.html\" class=\"btn\">Read More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn primary\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-slider\" style=\"background-image:url('img/slider19.png')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>University of Kinshasa <span>Welcomes</span> Sponsored  <span>Master\u2019s </span> Students</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The University of Kinshasa (UNIKIN) this week officially welcomed a group of Master\u2019s students under CSAS Project </p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.unikin.ac.cd/\" class=\"btn\">Visit UNIK</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"unik_news.html\" class=\"btn primary\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Single Slider -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-slider\" style=\"background-image:url('img/slider17.png')\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>All 4 students of<span> master's at BSU</span> had meeting<span> with the vice chancellor </span></h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>They have been assisted to catch up with the rest of the students in their respective programs since they came in late for the semester</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Visit BSU</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"bsu_news.html\" class=\"btn primary\">Learn More</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start End Slider -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/ End Slider Area -->\n\n\t\t<!-- Start Schedule Area -->\n\t\t<section class=\"schedule\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"schedule-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12 \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- single-schedule -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-schedule first\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"fa fa-bell\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><h4>Important Notice</h4></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Be cautious before giving out any personal data, please verify source of the information.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">LEARN MORE<i class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- single-schedule -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-schedule middle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icofont-prescription\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><h4><marquee direction=\"right\">Upcoming Events</marquee></h4></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>C-SAS Participates in EAIE Conference & Exhibition 2025 \u2013 Gothenburg, Sweden</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\">LEARN MORE<i class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-12 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- single-schedule -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-schedule last\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"inner\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"icon\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icofont-ui-clock\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"single-content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span><h4><marquee  direction=\"left\">News Updates</marquee></h4></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>CSAS Project team is delighted to share that our focal person will be participating in the EAIE Conference and Exhibition 2025</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"eaie_news.html\">LEARN MORE<i class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/End Start schedule Area -->\n\n\t\t<!-- Start About CSAS -->\n\t\t<section class=\"why-choose section\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"choose-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>About the CSAS Project</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>The Intra-Africa Academic Mobility Scheme of the European Union has provided\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfunding to support training of graduate students in Central and East African\n\t\t\t\t\t\tuniversities. In this mobility programme five African Partner Institutions and\n\t\t\t\t\t\tone EU Technical Partner will collaborate in the training of professionals in\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdeveloping climate smart agrifood systems that shall equip students and staff\n\t\t\t\t\t\twith a comprehensive understanding of climate-smart agrifood systems, incorporating\n\t\t\t\t\t\tdisciplines such as agriculture, environmental science, climate science and socio-economic\n\t\t\t\t\t\taspects of food systems.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/ End About CSAS -->\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- Start Call for the Mobility Scholarship 2024 -->\n\t\t<section class=\"why-choose section\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"choose-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Call for the Mobility Scholarship 2024</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A total of 26 Masters, 8 PhDs, will be trained in the thematic areas of Climate Smart Agriculture, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAgriculture and Rural Innovations, Dryland Agriculture, Livestock Production Systems, \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPlant Breeding and Seed Systems, Food Security, Geomatics and Artificial Intelligence. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe project will provide scholarship for full degree programs (PhD and MSc) as well as short term\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t mobility for students and staff that will run from 2024 to 2028.  <a href=\"https://c-sas.org/docs/CSAS_Scholarship_Advert.pdf\"><i class=\"fa fa-download\"> DOWNLOAD NOW  <i class=\"fa fa-file-pdf-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></i></a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The mobility project is expected to contribute to;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\"></i>a. Promoting inclusive academic mobility and partnerships between Higher Education Institutions / Universities (HEI) and Research Institutions to address key challenges in developing climate-smart agrifood systems.  </li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\"></i>b. Developing or strengthening curriculum on Climate-Smart Agrifood Systems in HEIs.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li><i class=\"fa fa-caret-right\"></i>c. Strengthening climate data and information systems using digital tools. </li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- End Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Choose Rights -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"choose-right\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"video-image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Video Animation -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"promo-video\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"waves-block\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"waves wave-1\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"waves wave-2\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"waves wave-3\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--/ End Video Animation -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RFVXy6CRVR4\" class=\"video video-popup mfp-iframe\"><i class=\"fa fa-play\"></i></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!-- End Choose Rights -->\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/ End Call for the Mobility Scholarship 2024 -->\n\n\t\t<!-- Start Why choose -->\n\t\t<section class=\"why-choose section\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"choose-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3></h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><h5>Disclaimer:</h5> Funded by the European Union. Views and opinions expressed are however those of the author(s) only and do not necessarily reflect those of the European Union or the European Education and Culture Executive Agency (EACEA). Neither the European Union nor EACEA can be held responsible for them.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<!-- End Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/ End Why choose -->\n\t\t\n\t\t<!-- Start Call to action -->\n\t\t<section class=\"call-action overlay\" data-stellar-background-ratio=\"0.5\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Do you need General Inquiries? Call/WhatsApp +237 677 660 304</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><h2>Email: info@c-sas.org</h2></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn\">Contact Now</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"btn second\">Learn More<i class=\"fa fa-long-arrow-right\"></i></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<!--/ End Call to action -->\n\n\t\t<!-- Start Why choose -->\n\t\t<section class=\"why-choose section\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<!-- Start Choose Left -->\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"choose-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Disclaimer for scholarship applicants</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Please be cautious when receiving any publicity inviting you to apply for an Intra-Africa scholarship\n\t\t\t\t\t\tor a message to pay a fee to be selected as a scholarship holder. We have been informed of\n\t\t\t\t\t\tnumerous atte